<title>LITHUANIA: AKMENES CEMENT'S H1 LOSSES INCREASE.</title>
<headline>AKMENES CEMENT'S H1 LOSSES INCREASE.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first half of 1997</p>
<p>					    (million litas unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     -1.156   vs 490,810</p>
<p>    Turnover				 52.258   vs 48.083</p>
<p>    Operating costs			41.393   vs 41.060</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     -1.205   vs -524,183</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain		   182,371  vs 78,560</p>
<p>    Extraordinary losses		 35,821   vs 0.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 -1.156   vs 490,810</p>
<p>NOTE -- Akmenes Cement reported a profit of 3.4</p>
<p>million litas in 1996 on turnover of 109.7 million litas.</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
